# Component split

No all-in-one page (header+filter+table+form+dialog in one file).

| Signal | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Route page > ~150 lines | Extract route section / client component |
| Repeated block ≥2 | Shared component |
| List+search+table | Extract a product list shell with typed composition |
| Dialog flow | Client dialog component + hook |

```
src/app/**/page.tsx → route composition and server boundary
src/components/<feature>/ → client sections and field groups
src/hooks/ → stateful client behavior
src/components/ui/ → shadcn primitives, no business logic
```

Dynamic routes use App Router segments: `src/app/{module}/[id]/page.tsx`;
editing uses an explicit child route or mode defined by the product.

No direct HTTP calls in child components and no duplicated product list shell.

With size limits: `platform-code-size.mdc`
